# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets out of it.
#
# Anything listed here is never sent to the Docker daemon, so it cannot end up
# in a layer even by accident.

# ── Secrets. First, and not negotiable. ──────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Rebuilt inside the image ─────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage

# ── Local and editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
*.local
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ── Not part of a production bundle ──────────────────────────────────
# Tests are run in CI and locally, never during the image build — including
# them would slow every build for no benefit.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
docs
supabase
README.md
CLAUDE.md
